Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't persecute someone\Nwho's yet to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So please look after my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your true father is Gold\NRoger, THE King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So for all these years,\NGold Roger had a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is massive news call the\Nhead office issue an extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's bloodline lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I fall far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Brattery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest thoughts\Nof all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Ace isn't Luffy's\Nreal brother after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, a miracle—the little bastard\Nsurvived this long. We know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,navy executed every person they could\Nfind who was connected to roger in any
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Way but I always thought his father was\NDragon. That's Luffy's father, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And their brothers, yeah, that's what\NI thought too. What's the deal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Luffy know about this\Nand he never told anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never gonna believe this,\Nbut I've got a baby on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For obvious reasons, I sadly won't\Nbe there for the kid's birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you telling\Nthis to a Navy officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize what'll happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get the mother\Nof your own damn child executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you so that doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt the\Ngovernment will manage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to dig up my whereabouts\Nfor the past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they do, they'll\Nfind her and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you approve of them punishing\Na child who hasn't even been born?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have tried to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,More times than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're an honorable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One that I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me you selfish bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him safe for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is the\Nisland we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have been a lot of rogers\Nsightings reported here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he wasn't acting like a\Npirate but instead like a man in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The navies put rogers\Nera to an end and we've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,got to cut the bloodline\Nto keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Check for pregnancy tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If they happened within 10 months of\Nhis capture, I want to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Round up any pregnant women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And kill any suspicious\Nmothers on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This month, five were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There are several due next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to hold on a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a girl, Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and if it's a boy, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those names, he picked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So his name is Goldie Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our son, our little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge! Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to\Nraise this child, Dadan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose baby is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you're with Dadan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying with her family,\Nand that's the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And be nice to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've both got the blood of\Ncriminals flowing through our veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the only gift\Nthose bastards ever gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the name Portgas from my\Nmother because I owe her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't owe my father a damned thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He can keep his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is my only father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, you took your\Nmother's maiden name as your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and with your exquisite\Nspeed and strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you quickly gained notoriety\Nthroughout the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,as the underlining captain\Nof the Spade Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's when we put\Nthe pieces together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no doubt that Roger's\Nblood had been passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But Whitebeard came to the same\Nrealization and got to you before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to secure your mantle\Nas the next king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he warmly accepted the son of\Nhis own rival aboard his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined my father's crew in\Norder to make him the next king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody believes that, except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think it took us\Nso long to finally catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You were under Whitebeard's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we know that if you were to go free,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd use your abilities\Nto become the next king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The only recourse we have to avoid\Nthis inevitable risk is to execute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it means we face the\Nprospect of war with Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral, the gate of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's opening without\Nany order from us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't make contact\Nwith the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's unexpected. It's opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they actually letting us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But that Navy guy said they were going\Nto leave us on the top curtain to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's in Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So who's behind this then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep opening just a little more now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One little further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really opening it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the chosen one! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop milking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is clearly a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is opening the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the universe really does\Nwant me to be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready battle stations, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did they get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an entire fleet of pirate ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out for Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bohemia Knight Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderlord Mock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The DeKalvin Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whirl Spider Squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got just about every big-time\Ncaptain from the new world with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've counted 43 ships in total,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no sign of\NWhitebeard or the Commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But every single one of them\Nis a sworn ally of Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Ace. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got your back, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to those children\Npanic. It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually came?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's got to be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's planted something big,\Nso keep your eyes on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for some war!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come on, Whitebeard, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't act like you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a shadow in the middle of the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't we plan for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They got their ships coated\Nto ambushes from underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Whitebeard's ship, the Moby Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more Whitebeard Pirate ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They've infiltrated the bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's First Division Commander Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting 14 commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Been quite some time, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you not killing my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we let\Nthem get this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm just worried your dear old\Ndad is gonna make an appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure those government\Nboys would love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon's not the type to sit\Nback while his son's killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When he's on a tear, things get nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, me and Ace, we\Ndon't have the same dad. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right about Dragon\Nbeing my dad, but not Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His dad is Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real shame we\Nnever got to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd always get mad\Nwhen I talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's supposed to be a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit tight for a second, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,FATHER!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he crack the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he set off a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but the water level's too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turning the ocean waters against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Whitebeard was\Nstrong, but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick some bodies. Take care, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you got it see ya in three years the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,next time you and me see each other\Ni'll be way stronger than you sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we show him how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat! I can't believe\Nhe became a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen their flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be new, but he's not wasting\Nany time in gaining notoriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,D, where is he from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been able to\Nfigure that out just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's clearly got the power of a Logia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect the terror of the Grand\NLine to be such a dashing young fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they offered him a warlord\Nposition, but he refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have these boys been at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're practically children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rushing like there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to do this, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to complain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to see red-haired shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Spade pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the rookie\Neveryone's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Came to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My little brother used to go on and on\Nabout you saving his life when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm here to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy? Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:22:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well come on in. I'm\Nglad to meet you, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,squat and let's talk\Nthis calls for a banquet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey big guy I bet you\Ncan put me in touch with
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,White Beard you might be\Nright but you'd still lose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that bet maybe i could\Nintroduce you but i won't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,captain do you realize\Nthat's Jimbae oh yeah Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating him might bring\Nus some prestige, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm my own pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of Whitebeard's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I owe him one, so\Nlet's see what you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have they been fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Five days?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.32,0:23:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard one of you boys has made it\Nyour life's mission to see me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.78,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Whitebeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One of me is enough for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleece bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Captain Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.02,0:23:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're getting cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.58,0:24:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew's not trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.36,0:24:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving me orders, you cocky punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some fight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not gonna kill\Nyou today, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.60,0:24:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too valuable to\Ndie in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Run wild with us and\Nour flag will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.78,0:24:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will call you my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.72,0:24:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a good friend to have. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of grumpy when you wake up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.06,0:25:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably wondering what\Nhappened. Since you passed out, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your crew proved their\Nloyalty and came to get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, of course, we beat\Nthe hell out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.62,0:25:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.44,0:25:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all in the ship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't I be in a cell or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.82,0:25:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have shackles on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shackles?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.81,0:25:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, we don't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what time it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.46,0:25:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got people trying\Nto sleep on this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.62,0:26:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, he went overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he can swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone fish him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.90,0:26:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been at it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.02,0:26:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid must be stuffed with guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.52,0:26:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that make a hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why does everyone\Non this ship call him Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he calls us sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.58,0:27:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us have any family left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.58,0:27:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, the whole world hates us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know it's just a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.78,0:27:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it still feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.06,0:27:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.26,0:27:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna keep on doing\Nthis even after he's spared your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you can't keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.10,0:27:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, but you're\Nnot strong enough to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can either get off\Nthis ship and start over,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or you can stay here and wear the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.16,0:27:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,mark of Whitebeard on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you must be Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, Ace did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.68,0:27:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He got Dome and his crew to\Nsurrender all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.30,0:28:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys want me to command\Nthe second division?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.92,0:28:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The post has been open for a\Nlong time, so just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nobody's gonna complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're part of the original crew, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't bother you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.98,0:28:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, not no slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no ambition for that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it for us, Commander Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.86,0:28:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn! I'm surprised I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.44,0:28:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Though to be honest you don't\Ntake after Old Roger much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He was your enemy, don't\Nyou want to kick me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The look on your face, I thought you\Nhad something important to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't think of\Nanything more trivial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.68,0:28:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the hell you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.64,0:28:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all children of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.26,0:29:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's sure on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.60,0:29:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He just picked up another strong rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.66,0:29:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard this new kid can breathe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.50,0:29:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please ace. Come on, just calm down.\NPop said he's gonna make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.76,0:29:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,with this one he doesn't want you\Ngoing after teach let me go i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.38,0:29:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,his commander aren't i if i don't\Nbring teach to justice for this how
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.16,0:29:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,can that just spirit ever rest ace
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.38,0:29:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,i know how you feel but let it go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.20,0:29:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,i've got a bad feeling about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The man killed his own\NGourmet and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've treated him like\Nyour son for decades now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:30:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he turns and spits in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disgraced my father's good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.02,0:30:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.34,0:30:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.44,0:30:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.68,0:30:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I ignored your advice and took\Noff on my own. Why the hell didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you just give up on me every bit\Nof this is my own damn fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.82,0:30:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.66,0:30:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.98,0:30:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,was i who
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.38,0:30:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,drove you to this my
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.90,0:31:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,son that's a lie you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.10,0:31:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,know the damn truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.06,0:31:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me not to go\Nafter him but i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.42,0:31:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, your captain,\Nand I told you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.60,0:31:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace was only following my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.02,0:31:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Marco? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it myself Then you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.80,0:31:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble really
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.34,0:31:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach broke the rules of our\Nship, and you had to seek justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the world knows what happens\Nif you mess with one of our crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.06,0:31:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you're going to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.78,0:31:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That means if anyone lays\Na finger on you, Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.84,0:31:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they're going to have to deal with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.24,0:31:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.54,0:31:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.34,0:31:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to make hell your\Nnew home, Navy bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.76,0:32:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, we asked for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.74,0:32:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That had better not be regret, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.54,0:32:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.18,0:32:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the final payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.92,0:32:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That harmless sea quake\Nhe threatened us with
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.34,0:32:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier was just the prelude\Nto a massive tsunami?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.00,0:32:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quake man is what they call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our forces may be many but that\Nwon't guarantee our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.92,0:32:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not against Whitebeard, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:33:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Before him, his crew, no one is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the power to destroy\Nthe world at his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.44,0:33:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great War.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.12,0:33:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The invaders, 47 pirate ships from\Nthe New World, led by Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.60,0:33:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The defenders the two\Ngreatest forces of the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.20,0:33:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,government navy hq and the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who wins no matter who loses\Nthe world will be forever changed?
